# Claude Code state.
# - Any .claude/ directory nested under a package or subdirectory (e.g.
#   packages/*/.claude/) is fully ignored - it's local scratch state.
# - The root .claude/ is ignored EXCEPT for settings.json, which is checked
#   in to register the elastic-integration-skills plugin marketplace for all
#   contributors (see CLAUDE.md).
.claude/
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/settings.json

/build

dev/packages

elastic-package

